M73 P0 R50
M73 Q0 S50
M201 X1000 Y1000 Z200 E5000 ; sets maximum accelerations, mm/sec^2
M203 X200 Y200 Z12 E120 ; sets maximum feedrates, mm / sec
M204 S1250 T1250 ; sets acceleration (S) and retract acceleration (R), mm/sec^2
M205 X8.00 Y8.00 Z0.40 E4.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M205 S0 T0 ; sets the minimum extruding and travel feed rate, mm/sec

; printing object 3DBenchy.stl id:0 copy 0
; stop printing object 3DBenchy.stl id:0 copy 0

;TYPE:Custom
M862.3 P "MK3SMMU3" ; printer model check
M862.1 P0.6 ; nozzle diameter check
M115 U3.14.1 ; tell printer latest fw version
G90 ; use absolute coordinates
M83 ; extruder relative mode
G28 W ; home all without mesh bed level

